## When to Use This Skill

Use the `{{ role_name }}` Ansible role when you need to configure {{ skill_name | replace('_', ' ') }} on remote hosts. Roles provide a higher-level abstraction than individual modules:

- Handles multiple tasks (install, configure, start) in one invocation
- Manages all related files, services, and dependencies
- Provides sensible defaults with full customization via variables
- Supports `--check` dry-run mode

