## Usage

Include the role in a playbook:

```yaml
---
- hosts: all
  roles:
    - role: {{ role_name }}
{% if entry_points.get("main", {}).get("options", []) %}
{% for o in entry_points["main"]["options"][:3] %}
{% if o.default is not none %}
      {{ o.name }}: {{ o.default }}
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
```

Run with:

```bash
ansible-playbook playbook.yml -i inventory.yml --check --diff
```

